  "source_confirmed": [
    "24 keys, two main rows, left consonants and right vowels; two thumb keys per hand required.",
    "Layer1 keeps right vowels unchanged; right-thumb MO(1) can be held through daijoubu.",
    "Modifier combos use vertically adjacent pairs; Shift is assigned to little fingers.",
    "Article says (Z) means Ctrl+Z.",
    "Optional nasal extension is shown but the author does not use it."
  ],
