    "Combo timing in ms, first-release versus all-release policy, held-key rollover, combo precedence.",
    "Tap/hold timeout and interrupted-tap behavior for the three dual-legend thumb keys.",
    "Whether blank cells are disabled or transparent in the real author firmware.",
    "Whether left/right hand modifier combos emit left or right USB modifier codes, and whether combos work on every auxiliary layer.",
    "Exact moment at which a modifier combo starts/stops and interaction with layer changes."
  ],
  "implementation_recommendations_not_source": [
    "Add a separate mato mode. Keep existing O24 and Mejiro maps and behavior untouched when that mode is off.",
    "Disable O24 compression combos while mato is active; mato vertical pairs mean modifiers, not compressed home-row letters.",
    "Preserve mato core layer1 access: replacing only letters while keeping all O24 thumb behavior loses half the consonants.",
    "Map 20 main positions and four required thumbs into Mejiro31; seven physical keys remain for mode switching and optional extra controls.",
